@host = http://localhost:5187

# Story 05 - Accept-Language (en, ar) sets the request culture. Problem titles, fixed problem details, and
# FluentValidation messages follow it; Content-Language echoes the resolved culture. Run against a Development
# API (`docker compose up -d` first). Compare with diagnostics.http requests 4, 6, 7 (no Accept-Language: English,
# byte-identical to before this story).
# Story 11: Customer rows are department-scoped; every POST /api/Agent/Customers request runs as agentA.
@agentA = 06000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000003

# Story 07: requests run as agent A, signed in below (access tokens expire after 2 minutes in Development -
# re-run the login when a request answers 401). Password: Identity:DevSeed:Password in appsettings.Development.json.
### Login as agent A
# @name loginAgentA
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agent.a@crm.local", "password": "Crm_Dev_2026!" }

@agentAToken = {{loginAgentA.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Arabic validation (acceptance criterion) - 400, title "فشل التحقق من صحة البيانات",
### errors.Type[0] "'Type' لا يجب أن يكون فارغاً.", errors.DisplayNameEn[0] "أدخل اسم العميل بالعربية أو الإنجليزية.",
### header Content-Language: ar
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "", "type": "", "preferredLanguage": "en" }

### 2. Same body, English - title "Validation failed", "'Type' must not be empty.", "Enter the customer's name in Arabic or English.",
### Content-Language: en
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "", "type": "", "preferredLanguage": "en" }

### 3. Parent-culture fallback - ar-SA,en;q=0.5 negotiates to ar (never ar-SA: no Hijri calendar)
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar-SA,en;q=0.5
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "", "type": "", "preferredLanguage": "en" }

### 4. Unsupported culture - fr falls back to the default, English
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: fr
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "", "type": "", "preferredLanguage": "en" }

### 5. No Accept-Language header - defaults to English
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "", "type": "", "preferredLanguage": "en" }

### 6. Status-code pages path - 404 title "غير موجود" (bare 404, no controller involved)
GET {{host}}/api/Admin/Nope
Accept-Language: ar

### 7. Exception-handler path - 500 title "خطأ داخلي", detail "حدث خطأ غير متوقع." (no exception text).
### Fails first if UseCrmRequestLocalization runs after UseExceptionHandler (Probe 1).
GET {{host}}/api/Admin/Diagnostics/throw
Accept-Language: ar
